'''Lurch Canyon''' was a canyon on the [[planet]] [[Pasaana]] not far from the [[Forbidden Valley]]. The canyon was home to the community of [[Aki-Aki]] and various species of native fauna, including the [[vexis]] and [[gouge-beetle]]s. It contained the [[Shifting Mires]], where the [[Sith cultist]] [[assassin]] [[Ochi]] was [[Death|killed]], leaving his [[starship]], the ''[[Bestoon Legacy]]'', abandoned on a bluff beyond the canyon.<ref name="TROS VD" />

